    "A glance at the Viridis family of colours (with primary aim of raising accessibility for colorblind readers):\n",
    "\n",
    "**《Viridis family》**\n",
    ">A = magma<br>\n",
    "B = inferno<br>\n",
    "C = plasma<br>\n",
    "D = viridis (default)<br>\n",
    "E = cividis (standard for publications)<br>\n",
    "F = rocket<br>\n",
    "G = mako<br>\n",
    "H = turbo<br>"
   ]
